OL,3,AJake Bugg reflects on 'vulnerable' new
OL,4,Aalbum he almost didn't release
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite such a personal record
OL,7,Fpotentially leaving him "very
OL,8,Fvulnerable", he decided "if somebody
OL,9,Fcan take a slight bit of comfort in
OL,10,Fthis record then the music's bigger
OL,11,Fthan myself".
